OL,3,AMurder arrest after two people found
OL,4,Adead at house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after two people were found dead
OL,8,Fin a house in Blackburn.
OL,10,FLancashire Police said the bodies of a
OL,11,Fman and woman were found at the home in
OL,12,FHardman Street in the town at about
OL,13,F08:20 BST, and a man aged in his 40s
OL,14,Fhad been arrested.
OL,16,FThe man and woman, who have not been
OL,17,Fnamed, were both pronounced dead at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,20,FPolice said they were unable to confirm
OL,21,Fthe victims' ages but local residents
OL,22,Ftold the BBC they were elderly.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
